  "display_title": "Hold Me When the Full Moon Rises",
  "description": "Blair, known for being promiscuous, is cursed to suffer from a fever if he does not have sex on the day of the full moon. The curse started when he was young and was captured by wolves in the forest and returned, and Blair believes it was the young wolf he met at that time who did it. While searching for someone to relieve his fever as usual, but coming up empty-handed, Blair is hugged from behind by a strange man. With his shirt off, his long hair, and his obvious suspiciousness, this man claims to be Blair's companion...?\n\n *\"I found you, my companion.\"*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
